1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,188
Syria has delayed the first session of its transitional parliament without giving a clear explanation.

2
00:00:07,138 --> 00:00:15,226
Al Jazeera reports that the delay adds uncertainty to a fragile political process after years of conflict.

3
00:00:15,226 --> 00:00:21,549
A transitional assembly is supposed to give different groups a path into public decision-making.

4
00:00:21,549 --> 00:00:30,005
When its opening is postponed, citizens and foreign governments may question whether promised reforms are moving forward.

